  [
    id 77
    name "78"
    label "EPXbWEFQ008"
    step 0
    date "2020-12-08T05:00:11Z"
    title "THE BEST ABS WORKOUT | Get ABS in 3 WEEKS | Rowan Row"
    description "&#9658; THE BEST ABS WORKOUT | Get ABS in 3 WEEKS | Rowan Row &#10;&#8226; Shop Bulk Powders supplements - www.awin1.com/awclick.php?mid=4822&#38;id=765753&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;&#10;&#8226; My Fitness app &#8226; &#10;&#8226; https://apps.apple.com/gb/app/rowan-row-fitness/id1521683735&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;&#10;&#8226; My Links &#8226;&#10;Instagram &#8226; https://www.instagram.com/rowanrow&#10;Facebook &#8226; https://www.facebook.com/rowanrow&#10;Twitter &#8226; https://twitter.com/rowanrowrowan&#10;Website &#8226; https://www.rowanrow.com&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#10;&#8226; Music &#8226; &#10;Epidemic Sound &#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#10;&#8226; Contact &#8226; info@rowanrow.com&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#10;&#8226; The Routine &#8226; &#10;1. High crunches &#10;2. Long arm crunches &#10;3. Reverse crunches &#10;4. Scissors&#10;5. Leg raises&#10;6. Pulse up&#10;7. V ups &#10;8. Sitting punches &#10;9. Hollow hold &#10;10. Bicycle kicks &#10;11. Heel taps &#10;12. Dynamic plank &#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#10;&#8226;  Subscribe to my channel here: https://www.youtube.com/rowanrow&#10;----------------------------------------&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;&#173;----------------------------------&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#173;-&#10;Here&#8217;s a very basic and super effective abs/6pack workout for all kind of levels that you can perform it at home or anywhere you go because does not require any gym equipment at all. To get the best results out of it all you need is consistency and commitment. Takes less then 3 weeks to show up the results if you push it hard to the limits every day. Of course with a balanced diet you will get even better results. Please do comment below and let me know how you find it. Thank you for the constant support :)"
