    id 82
    name "83"
    label "Kc5-kYMGsOU"
    step 0
    date "2019-09-23T16:00:06Z"
    title "10 MIN LOWER AB WORKOUT (GET YOUR LOWER ABS TO SHOW!)"
    description "Get ready for one of the best Lower Ab Workouts of your LIFE! Let's do this! A full home ab workout that you can do whenever and wherever you like!! You don't need any equipment or weight.&#10;&#10;This video is full length which means you can just follow along with whatever I'm doing. If you need extra rest, just pause the video. If you don't need a rest - watch it the whole way through.&#10;&#10;You can hit this home workout 2-3x per week - and if you wanted to keep active on your other days - be sure to check out my other workouts!&#10;&#10;1) Scissor Lying Leg Raise&#10;2) Reverse Crunch&#10;3) Core Body Rocks&#10;4) Core Plank Ups&#10;5) Kickback Knee In&#10;6) Mountain Climbers&#10;7) Bodyweight Crunch&#10;8) L Sit Crunches&#10;9) Lunge Knee Ups&#10;10) Cross Body Crunch&#10;11) Stretc &#38; Catch Breath&#10;12) Knee In To Hip Raise&#10;13) Oblique Heel Taps&#10;14) Explosive Sit up&#10;15) Side Plank Hip Ups&#10;16) Plank Knee Ins&#10;17) Flutter Kicks&#10;18) High Knee Runs&#10;&#10;Pants in this video are by Gymshark.&#10;Be A Visionary: https://gym.sh/Shop-Fraser&#10;&#10;&#128073;Coaching Programs: https://www.fraserwilsonfitness.com&#10;&#128073;Subscribe: (https://goo.gl/84uFTA)&#10;&#128073;Supplements: http://1upnutrition.com CODE: FRASERFIT&#10;&#10;ADD ME ON:&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/FraserWilsonFit/&#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/FraserWilsonFit/&#10;Snapchat: FraserWilsonFit&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Ship Wrek, Zookeepers &#38; Trauzers - Vessel [NCS Release]: https://youtu.be/PXf4rkguwDI&#10;&#10;Futuristik - Forgive Me [NCS Release]: https://youtu.be/E8VwtjhMFJ8&#10;&#10;Kisma - Fingertips [NCS Release]:&#10;https://youtu.be/LJeiQw2RmSg"
