    description "Thank you so much for watching! Please don't forget to like, comment and subscribe to see more videos. Hope to see you in my next video.&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;SUBSCRIBE : youtube.com/c/AnnabelleHayes&#10;INSTAGRAM : https://www.instagram.com/bellsebobo/?hl=en&#10;TWITTER : https://twitter.com/bellsebobo?lang=en&#10;SNAPCHAT :  @Bellsebobo&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;MY FITNESS WEBSITE: https://www.annabellehayes.com/&#10;MY FITNESS PROGRAMS: https://www.annabellehayes.com/programs-1/&#10;MY BLOG: https://www.annabellehayes.com/fitness-2/&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;BUSINESS EMAIL: annabellefhayes@gmail.com&#10;ADVICE EMAIL: contactbellsebobo@gmail.com&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;EXERCISE LIST:&#10;Single Leg Raise Crunch: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps&#10;Single Leg Crunches: 3 Sets X 15-20 Reps&#10;Rope Crunches: 3 Sets X 20-25 Reps&#10;Knee To Chest Crunches: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps&#10;High-Cable Woodchops: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps&#10;Low-Cable Woodchops: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps&#10;Cable Twists: 3 Sets X 10-15 Reps&#10;Cable Toe Touches: 3 Sets X 15-20 Reps&#10;Cable Side Bends: 3 Sets X 15-20 Reps&#10;Cable Mountain Climbers: 3 Sets X 15-20 Reps&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;MUSIC:&#10;SANDR:&#10;https://soundcloud.com/sandredm&#10;https://www.facebook.com/SANDRedm&#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...&#10;Music provided by RFM: https://youtu.be/3tq3Gr-92kk&#10;&#10;Elexive:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/DerAdryan&#10;https://www.facebook.com/elexive&#10;https://soundcloud.com/elexive&#10;https://twitter.com/elexive&#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...&#10;Music provide