    description "This is workout 2 of my bulletproof abs challenge. And let me tell you, it&#8217;s not going to be easy. So please don&#8217;t be discouraged if you cannot complete it without stopping. If you follow the 3 week schedule (included in the video) you will get much stronger, and over time, you will be able to complete the entire workout without stopping &#128579; Good luck everyone!&#10;&#10;Workout 1: https://youtu.be/AhacqRkIFb8&#10;Workout 2: This Video&#10;&#10;Clothing brand: PHLURT &#10;Shop at: https://phlurtofficial.com&#10;Instagram: @phlurt&#10;&#10;If you would like to listen to your own &#34;favourite&#34; music, try my non-music version with beeps only:&#10;https://youtu.be/Roi7MG3rG7g&#10;&#10;My 12 week Booty Boost program &#38; Resistance Bands:&#10;https://getfitbyivana.com&#10;&#10;My Booty Boost program is designed to achieve progressive booty growth by doing the right volume of training and the right choice of exercises.&#10;&#10;The program includes:&#10;- A comprehensive 12 week booty workout plan&#10;- 9 follow-through workout videos&#10;- A 12 week (day-by-day) follow-through booty schedule&#10;- A progress tracking page (before &#38; after photos, booty measurement, strength assessment)&#10;- A private photo library&#10;- Plus more!&#10;&#10;&#129419; SHARE AND POST YOU PROGRESS PICTURES ON INSTAGRAM AND USE #getfitbyivana&#10;#bootyboostprogram&#10;&#10;&#128247; Instagram: getfitbyivana_&#10;https://www.instagram.com/getfitbyivana_/?hl=en&#10;&#128038; Twitter: getfitbyivana&#10;https://twitter.com/getfitbyivana&#10;&#128233; Business Enquires: &#10;getfitbyivana@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Music by:&#10;1)&#10;Song: Sad Puppy - Getting Higher&#10;Link: https://youtu.be/MAN9aW-oiSU&#10;Music promoted by FreeMusicWave.&#10;2)&#10;Shiva by Luke Bergs https://soundcloud.com/bergscloud&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-SA 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/32UgPDq&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/OA8DXf3uYkc&#10;3)&#10;Track: NEFFEX - Life&#10;Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPCaWQQo11A&#10;4)&#10;Track: Max Ryper - Never Get Old&#10;Music provided by Beast Trap&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/unaSNM7lVkk&#10;Free Download/Stream: https://hypeddit.com/link/055o17"
