    title "6 Pack Abs Workout (BURNS FAT TOO!)"
    description "6 Pack Abs Workout that can be done by anyone, anywhere. Use this workout to get Abs and Burn Fat Too!&#10;&#10;Here&#8217;s the workout for a six pack:&#10;&#10;Lower Abs: One Down Two Ups x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Fat Burning: Pendulum Climbers x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Bottom Up Rotation: Figure 8&#8217;s x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Fat Burning: Skater Twists x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Obliques: Recliner Elbow to Knee Tucks x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Fat Burning: High Knees x 45 Seconds&#10;Midrange Abs: Power Ups x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Fat Burning: Elbow to Knee Thrusts Right x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Top Down Rotation: Plank Toe Taps x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Fat Burning: Elbow to Knee Thrusts Left x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;Top Down Abs: Levitation Crunches x 45 Seconds / 15 Seconds Rest&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ATHLEAN-X&#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/athleanx&#10;Instagram: @athleanx | https://www.instagram.com/athleanx/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/athleanx&#10;&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-X TRAINING PROGRAMS: https://athleanx.com/the-training&#10;&#10;SUPPLEMENT YOUR TRAINING: https://athleanx.com/athleanrx&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-X APPAREL: https://athleanx.com/fitness-apparel&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-X RESISTANCE BANDS: https://athleanx.com/elast-x-resistance-bands&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-BLOX: https://athleanx.com/athleanx-blox&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-X BLOG: https://athleanx.com/articles&#10;&#10;ATHLEAN-X RESULTS: https://athleanx.com/reviews-and-testimonials&#10;&#10;&#10;If you are looking for a step-by-step training program that will have you looking and feeling the best you ever have while getting a ripped 6 pack, then check out all of our workout plans at https://athleanx.com"
