    title "Weighted Six Pack Ab Workout ( Ab Exercise Modifications)"
    description "For 3 free tips on how to build muscle fast customized for your body type and your goals, take my free body type fitness quiz - &#13;http://vshred.fit/Weighted6PackAbs&#10;&#13;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! Abs are made in the kitchen but those brick abs require something else and there isn&#8217;t a single ab workout in existence that will get rid of belly fat.&#10;&#10;But if you want those bricky, popping, 3D looking, six pack abs, you&#8217;ve gotta throw in some weighted movements from time to time. Adding weights to certain ab exercises can make a significant difference because your abs are like any other muscle in your body, they need progressive overload if you want them to pop. Today I am taking you through an ab workout that consists of four of my favorite weighted ab movements! &#10;&#10;Try adding these exercises to your ab workouts at least once a week, and I know you will see a significant difference!&#10;&#10;#VShred #WeightedSixPackAbWorkout #howtogetabs&#10;&#10;&#127947;&#127996;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039; WEIGHTED SIX PACK AB WORKOUT &#127947;&#127996;&#8205;&#9794;&#65039;&#10;Do 3 sets of 8-10 repetitions of each exercise below. Rest approx 60-90 seconds between sets.&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;00:00 - Intro&#10;01:57 - Body Type Fitness Quiz&#10;02:18 - Workout Breakdown &#10;02:39 - Hanging Dumbbell Leg Raises (Power Tower for beginners)&#10;04:56 - Barbell Straight-Arm Sit-Up (No BB for beginners)&#10;06:54 - Side to Side Cable Crunch&#10;09:02 - Side Plank Hip Dips w/Dumbbell (No DB for beginners)&#10;10:49 - In Closing&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying this ab exercise routine out? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Weighted Six Pack Ab Workout ( Ab Exercise Modifications)&#10;https://youtu.be/o1uif6PRLjo&#13;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#13;&#10;For Fat Loss: http://vshred.fit/YTFatLossStack425&#10;For Muscle Building: http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuildingStack425&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
