    title "10 MIN. Beginner ABS Workout | Fat Burner"
    description "Welcome to a new 10 minute beginner friendly ABS WORKOUT &#128153;&#10024;&#10;&#10;These are exercises designed to activate your abs (including the core) without putting undue stress in any of the supporting muscle structure. Perfect for beginners but also a great set of abs exercises for those wishing to maintain ab strength.&#160;&#10;&#10;This session consists of 12 exercises, each one lasts for 40 seconds and a 10 seconds rest in between is included. Remember that regularity is the key to success and good results! Train regularly, eat well and rest well. &#10;Be active. Be inspired. And now let&#8217;s start! &#128153;&#9889;&#65039;&#10;&#10;My Instagram: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/olyakrr/&#10;&#10;If you want to help me and share this training with your friends (Much appreciated&#128522;) :&#10;https://youtu.be/8h5CUB4MW3s&#10;&#10;0:00 Start&#10;0:10 Dead Bugs&#10;1:00 T-Cross Tow Taps&#10;1:52 Flutter Kicks&#10;2:40 Seated Twists&#10;3:29 Knee Crunches To Leg Lowers&#10;4:20 Heel Taps&#10;5:10 Knee to Elbow Crunches&#10;6:00 Reverse Crunches&#10;6:51 Kneeling Side Plank Dips L&#10;7:41 Kneeling Side Plank Dips R&#10;8:31 Slow Mountain Climbers&#10;9:21 Elbow Plank&#10;10:00 Mission Complete!&#10;&#10;Get SEJODIOTO by KAROL G here https://lickd.lnk.to/E0bJdyID!Olya%20TV&#10;&#10;License ID: QV931nnP6L1&#10;&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;&#10;Get Used to Love You by Anne-Marie here https://lickd.lnk.to/hE0LXZID!Olya%20TV&#10;&#10;License ID: w0J3wmm1YPV&#10;&#10;Get this and other songs for your next YouTube video at https://lickd.co&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;In order to avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health before doing the exercises. Performing any fitness exercises without supervision, is at your own risk. Please take&#10;professional advices of a fitness professional. Olya TV will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video.&#10;&#10;#sport &#10;#homeworkout &#10;#beginnerfriendly"
