    title "Trying the Daisy Keech 8 Minute Hourglass Ab Workout For 7 Days"
    description "Can you get abs by doing and 8 minute workout for 7 days? I decided to put the@Daisy Keech 8 minute ab workout to the test. Here is my progress + what I ate every day and my results.&#10;&#10;Before this I was very out of shape. For the eating I didn't really make changes from my usual diet, because I wanted to make sure I would get results that are realistic for me to keep up. I hope you enjoy this challenge!&#10;&#10;* both my vlog camera and phone broke on day 7, so sorry that the quality is a little lower at the end! *&#10;&#10;Overnight Oat Recipe:&#10;organic oats&#10;nutmeg and/or cinnamon&#10;chia seeds&#10;hemp seeds&#10;dried dates&#10;blueberries (or any fruit of your choice)&#10;coconut milk&#10;Leave in the fridge overnight and enjoy the next morning!&#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;0:00 - Day 1&#10;4:09 - Day 2&#10;6:17 - How to Make Overnight Oats&#10;7:29 - Day 3&#10;9:32 - Day 4&#10;10:53 - Day 5&#10;12:29 - Day 6&#10;13:46 - Day 7 + results&#10;&#10;&#10;#daisykeech #workoutchallenge #vlog &#10;&#10;&#10;------&#10;Music by Citrus Avenue - Espresso Sun - https://thmatc.co/?l=BF69D9DB&#10;Music by Syphax - Dysmorphia - https://thmatc.co/?l=51CC4C8D&#10;Music by Nasir Ibrahim - Get ready - https://thmatc.co/?l=37CA4946&#10;------&#10;&#10;&#129419;&#10;LINKS:&#10;AMAZON STOREFRONT: https://www.amazon.com/shop/thejoyen&#10;VINTAGE STORE: https://www.etsy.com/shop/ShopEdgeVintage&#10;&#10;&#10;&#129419; SOCIAL MEDIA &#10;Instagram: @thejoyen&#10;Tiktok: Thejoyen&#10;&#10;&#129419;  BUSINESS EMAIL: thejoyen@gmail.com"
