    title "15 Minute Ab Workout | Ambition-Day 15"
    description "15 MINUTE AB WORKOUT- Get awesome abs with this 15 minute ab workout. This 15 minute ab workout is for all fitness levels. The exercises will be demonstrated and the modifications of each exercise will be provided.&#10;&#10;Each exercise will be performed for 40 seconds and there will be a 20 second rest between each exercise.  All exercises will be performed for 3 rounds. There is a short warm-up and cool down during this workout.&#10;&#10;15 Minute Ab Workout &#10;1.) Punch Crunches&#10;2.) Hundreds&#10;3.) Oblique Side Crunch Right Side&#10;4.) Oblique Side Crunch Left Side&#10;5.) Bird Dog&#10;&#10;Time Stamps:&#10;00:00 15 Minute Ab Workout Introduction&#10;00:33 15 Minute Ab Workout Warm-Up&#10;00:53 Punch Crunches&#10;04:03 Hundreds&#10;07:22 Oblique Side Crunch Right Side&#10;10:37 Oblique Side Crunch Left Side&#10;13:53 Bird Dog&#10;16:42 15 Minute Ab Workout Cooldown&#10;&#10;&#9989; Subscribe for more FREE tips and workouts on how to reach your fitness goals: &#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0igEEZrTMF3Tntl2G4138Q&#10;&#10;#15minuteabworkoutplank #abworkout &#10;&#10;&#128064;WATCH NEXT: &#10;https://youtu.be/rCb01yjCGb8&#10;&#10;&#128077;FREE GUIDE:&#10;&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/6-week-ambition-program&#10;&#128073; Free Guide http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-guide&#10;&#128073;Free 5k plan http://www.shannaafitness.com/free-5k-training-plan&#10;&#10;&#10;//WORK WITH SHANNA&#10;&#128073;1-on-1 online fitness coaching&#10;http://www.shannaafitness.com/online-coaching&#10;&#10;//COME SAY HI!&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/shannaafitness&#10;&#10;&#10;//ABOUT: My name is Shanna, a licensed physical education teacher, and NASM certified personal trainer, a veteran marathon runner, and a mom of 3! I am here to help moms get in the best shape of their life by becoming a runner and losing the weight for good! I'll provide tips on how to reach fitness goals, getting to your ideal healthy weight without extreme dieting, tips for sticking with a consistent exercise plan, and achieving a positive mindset.&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thank you for supporting my channel so I can continue to provide you with free content each week!&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: The fitness information is provided for general informational and educational purposes only and is not a substitute for professional advice. Accordingly, before taking any actions based upon such information, we encourage you to consult with the appropriate professionals. We do not provide any kind of fitness advice. THE USE OR RELIANCE OF ANY INFORMATION CONTAINED ON THIS CHANNEL IS SOLELY AT YOUR OWN RISK.&#10;&#10;//CONTACT:&#10;&#10;For all subscribers, please use this email: shanna@shannaafitness.com&#10;&#10;For all business inquiries, please use this email: shanna@shannaafitness.com"
